  "lyrics": "[The Build]\n[03:48.10]So keep this world with me\n[03:51.14]I said, Light\n[03:53.36]And the melody turned gold\n[03:54.94]I said, Move\n[03:56.20]And gravity found the beat\n[03:58.44]I said, Live\n[03:59.92]And every sound came home\n[The Climax]\n[04:06.00]Every sound becomes a body\n[04:09.98]Every echo learns to breathe\n[04:14.76]What the noise creates\n[04:17.66]the silence takes\n[04:19.74]So keep this world with me\n[04:26.39]Voices into brass\n[04:29.32]Steps into drums\n[04:32.00]Blood into bass\n[04:34.29]Rain into light\n[04:37.50]Every echo, alive\n[The Collapse]\n[04:43.72]Then, I stopped speaking",
